      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2024\n2,800+ microservices\n\nNew model: a central\nplatform team drives\nmigrations, no per-team\nvote required.\n\n80/20 codemods +\nconfig-service rollout,\nroll back in seconds.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2024\n2,800+ microservices\n\nNew model: a central\nplatform team drives\nmigrations, no per-team\nvote required.\n\n80/20 codemods +\nconfig-service rollout,\nroll back in seconds.",
      "lineHeight": 1.3
