      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1,500 -> 2,000 -> 2,800+ microservices (2020-2024). Team autonomy scaled the product.\nIt could not scale platform-wide migrations, so Monzo centralized that one decision instead.",
